// Culture packs (plan §2.9, §5 Phase 1). One per name pool in content/base/names. The calendar is twelve five-day months (a 60-day year,
// four 15-day seasons of three months each: spring, summer, autumn, winter). Feast days name a month (1..12) and a day (1..5).
// "crimes" maps a crime id to a punishment table key (resolved later by the law system); hearth_tax is in pence per hearth per year.
